ht beside her, turning one warrior into a small army against the Raxes, demons that have escaped from ancient cities.\n\nMoving through those cities unlocks additional weapons and spells for facing a larger threat. Planning how and when to use the clones matters as much as quick reactions. It is a single-player game with full controller support, suited to players who enjoy action games with a tactical, puzzle-like layer."}}